WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.944
Mom: It's Saturday, everyone. Here is a list of chores.

2
00:00:06.945 --> 00:00:11.671
Ricky: Chores? I hate

3
00:00:11.672 --> 00:00:14.135
chores. Dad: Today will be different,

4
00:00:14.136 --> 00:00:17.354
Ricky. Today you will get an allowance.

5
00:00:17.355 --> 00:00:19.870
Rachel: What's an allowance?

6
00:00:19.871 --> 00:00:23.744
Ricky: It's money that you earn by doing

7
00:00:23.748 --> 00:00:26.738
chores. Mom: I want both of you to make your

8
00:00:26.739 --> 00:00:30.207
beds. Then you can collect the garbage, Ricky.

9
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:35.471
Ricky: I'm going to start right

10
00:00:35.472 --> 00:00:39.534
now. Let's work together. It will be quicker.

11
00:00:39.535 --> 00:00:46.815
Rachel: Okay, Ricky. Let's make your bed first.

12
00:00:46.816 --> 00:00:51.359
Ricky: Grab that corner, Rachel.

13
00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:55.175
I'll take this one. Flap it in the air.

14
00:00:55.176 --> 00:01:17.506
Rachel: That was easy. Let's do my bed.

15
00:01:17.507 --> 00:01:28.326
Ricky: I'm going to use my wagon.

16
00:01:28.327 --> 00:01:35.854
You push and I'll steer.

17
00:01:35.855 --> 00:01:38.243
Rachel: You're heavy, Ricky!

18
00:01:38.244 --> 00:01:43.474
Ricky: Okay, I'll help.

19
00:01:43.475 --> 00:01:50.440
Whew! Mom:

20
00:01:50.441 --> 00:01:57.344
Ricky Raccoon, clean up this mess right now! Ricky:

21
00:01:57.345 --> 00:02:01.891
Sorry, Mom. Rachel:

22
00:02:01.892 --> 00:02:04.119
I'll help, Ricky.

23
00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:12.177
Ricky: Thanks, Rachel. I will share my allowance with you.

